Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3-cairo,
 python3-gi-cairo, python3-pil, python3-numpy, python3-scipy, python3-haltia-kit
Recommends: pulseaudio-utils
Description: colour by number on famous paintings, large and calm
 Раскраска (Paint) is a colour-by-number game in the style of Happy Color:
 a painting is split into numbered regions, a tap fills a region with the
 chosen colour. It comes with public-domain paintings, makes pictures from
 one's own photos and finds paintings on Wikidata. No timer, score or ads.
 Part of Haltia, a calm touch desktop; it runs on any GTK desktop.
